JGR starts up an REngine and the console implements the REPL. It is  
not really meant to be used after R has already been started. You can  
sort of fake it a little (see Deducer: http://www.rforge.net/ 
Deducer/) by using setREngine() and creating a dummy JGRConsole (see  
Deducer: http://www.rforge.net/Deducer/), but this may change.


